# Formspree (or compatible) form endpoint, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
# Create a free account at https://formspree.io, add a form, and paste its endpoint here.
# Until this is set, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's email client.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public) for the contact form's spam check.
# Leave empty to hide the widget. For local testing use Cloudflare's test key
# 1x00000000000000000000AA (always passes). The secret key goes in Formspree, never here.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
